### Status code: 301 Moved Permanently
# Moved permanently for port 443 (HTTPS) stead of 80 (HTTP)
# @no-redirect
GET / HTTP/1.1
Host: developer.mozilla.org
User-Agent: Rest Client (VSCode)


### Status code: 302 Found
# Needs to specify the resource different from /
# @no-redirect
GET https://developer.mozilla.org/ HTTP/1.1
Host: developer.mozilla.org
User-Agent: Rest Client (VSCode)


### Status code: 200 Ok
# @no-redirect
GET https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/ HTTP/1.1
Host: developer.mozilla.org
User-Agent: Rest Client (VSCode)

### 201 Created
POST https://api.github.com/repos/fgopassos/repo1-demo-git/issues HTTP/1.1
Host: api.github.com
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv GITHUB_TOKEN}}

{
  "title": "Test issue",
  "body": "This is a test issue created via the GitHub API."
}

### Status code: 400 Bad Request
# Query should follow an specific format, such as:
# https://api.fda.gov/food/event.json?search=products.industry_code:23
# @no-redirect
GET https://api.fda.gov/food/event.json?query=products.industry_code:23 HTTP/1.1
Host: api.fda.gov


### Status code: 401 Unauthorized
# Missing credentials...
GET /v2/search/instant?query=hamburger HTTP/1.1
Host: trackapi.nutritionix.com:443


### Status code: 404 Not Found
GET /not-a-resource HTTP/1.1
Host: www.nasa.gov


### 405 Method Not Allowed
PUT / HTTP/1.1
Host: example.com
Content-Type: application/json

{}

